nges to Martial Arts for one other skill: costs { martial_arts: 1 }. Pilot any is read to include the Horsemanship category at +5%; except spacecraft and robots drops Robots & Power Armor, Robot Combat and Space: rows. The natural climb 90/80%, acrobatics 80%, swim 80% and prowl 60% are instinctive and stay prose; the R.C.C. list''s Climb (+10%) is stored as printed. || EQUIPMENT: back-pack, utility belt, pouches or sacks as one pouch, lighter, flashlight, knife. Not stored: energy pistol, energy rifle, sword or vibro-blades, neuro-mace, magic wands, staves and items (typical items, none named)."
